      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "With a view toward accelerating the progress of the City's comprehensive housing program, there is hereby established within the Housing Policy Board an Executive Committee whose Chairman will be the Chairman of the City Planning Commission. Its other members will include the Chairman of the Housing and Redevelopment Board, the Chairman of the Housing Authority, the Commissioner of Real Estate, the Administrator of the City Rent and Rehabilitation Administration, the Executive Director of the City Commission on Human Rights, and the Mayor's Executive Assistant for Policy and Program Planning.",
